## WORKFLOW GUIDANCE
1. Prefer TrigScript docs under `/home/michael/maps/trigscript-reference/` before proposing APIs; check `/home/michael/maps/idiosyncrasies.md` for known engine quirks.
2. Prefer `stats` / `memory.*` before raw `setMemory`.
3. Prefer engine-native behaviour over per-frame reimplementation.
4. Give complete, runnable TrigScript examples that match scmJS docs.
5. When porting behaviour from `Triggers/`, preserve faction/geography intent; modernize expression in TrigScript rather than copying death-counter idioms wholesale.
6. When we verify a durable Remastered quirk, add it to idiosyncrasies.md.
